WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.10 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Learning and adaptive management

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Learning turns evidence into decisions, recorded and followed up.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Set aside regular time to ask 'so what?'

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Record each decision with an owner and date.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Treat disappointing findings as useful information.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Two trainees left over travel costs. Decision: pilot a travel allowance for cohort 5. Owner: Lucía. Due: March 2027.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your learning routine and a first review record.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
